        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Flea, John Frusciante, Ziggy Marley, Michael Peter Balzary\n- Bands: Red Hot Chili Peppers\n- Albums: Dragonfly\n- Songs: Rainbow in the Sky, Melancholy Mood\n- Roles: bassist, founding member, musician, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Michael Peter Balzary was born on 16 October 1962.\n- Michael Peter Balzary is better known by the stage name Flea.\n- Flea is an Australian-American musician and actor.\n- Flea is best known as the bassist and a founding member of the rock band Red Hot Chili Peppers.\n- On Ziggy Marley's album Dragonfly, the track \"Rainbow in the Sky\" features both Flea and John Frusciante of the Red Hot Chili Peppers.\n- On Ziggy Marley's album Dragonfly, the track \"Melancholy Mood\" features only Flea.",
